# Property 2 setup (included by held-mana-heal-pre.keys and
# held-mana-heal-cast.keys): wound the character with a summoned goblin.
# The goblin fights back because tools/gates/Options.Dat has Freeze Monsters
# NO (read off the wizard switches screen). Do NOT toggle that switch here:
# a toggle turns it ON.
w
@choose "Monster Summoning"
@choose "Goblinkin"
@choose "goblin"
RIGHT ENTER
@while "more --" SPACE
@dump:goblin
RIGHT
@while "more --" SPACE
@until "HP:2" .
@dump:hurt
